Tables
-------
--Tables are defined with table tag 
<table> </table>
--Rows are defined with tr tag 
<tr> </tr>
--Columns or cells are defined with td tags 
<td> </td>
-- Cell headings are defined with 
<th> </th>

attribtues
----------
**border=1
**cell padding=3 it creates the space inside the cell
**cellspacing=3 it creates  the space around the cell
**width =30% 
**heigth=there is no ending point so we didnt give the percentage
so we shild give in pixels

How to add images
-----------------
we have 2 ways to add images
1.absolute path
<img src=''>
--It is self closing tag
atrributes
----------
**width in percentage
**heigth in pixels
**alt-display the text replace of image if image is break then the user the image is there
2.relative path
in this we  take the image from our device

